WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.540
Then there’s what happened before the camera
was there.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:08.300
In Memory, Evelyn’s conversations keep her
plan: tea first, then the plant.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.340
The source is one click away.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.140
We can pick up where she left off.
